Package: uwubuntu-apps
Version: @PKG_VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: UwUbuntu Developers <uwubuntu@example.org>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, flatpak, apt, pkexec, uwubuntu-branding
Homepage: @DISTRO_HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@'s own furry apps
 UwU Welcome (first-run tour and Flathub app picker), UwU Settings (look,
 animations, terminal and startup tweaks) and Paw Updater (system and
 Flatpak updates in one click).
